==History==
2025
*The Rune Giant was added to the game on 6/1/2025, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (6/1/2025)|January 2025 Update]].
*On 21/1/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (21/1/2025)|maintenance break]], made it so the enchantment stays on troops even after Rune Giant is defeated instead of going away.
*On 30/1/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (30/1/2025)|maintenance break]], made it so that damage boost from the Rune Giant would be split on troops with attacks with multiple projectiles instead of being granted to each projectile. It also made it so that troops that have another troop attached would no longer recieve the damage boost on the attached troop.
*On 4/3/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/3/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Rune Giant's hitpoints by 11% and made it so the enchantment expires 5 seconds after she is defeated.
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], made it so that Rune Giant would no longer be able to enchant troops if captured by [[Goblin Cage/Evolution|Evolved Goblin Cage]] and made it so that [[Electro Dragon/Evolution|Evolved Electro Dragon]]'s boost from a Rune Giant would apply every third attack instead of every third hit in each attack. It also fixed various issues related to Rune Giant’s enchantment damage.
*On 3/6/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/6/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Rune Giant's hitpoints by 6%.

